":205,"_60":19,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":66,"_56":198,"_68":199,"_60":19,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":196,"_58":197,"_60":19,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":191,"_68":192,"_60":33,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":189,"_58":190,"_60":33,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":181,"_68":182,"_60":183,"_62":-7},{"_54":66,"_56":177,"_68":178,"_60":179,"_62":-7},{"_54":172,"_60":173,"_56":174,"_68":175,"_64":65},{"_54":162,"_60":122,"_56":163,"_79":164,"_89":165,"_33":166,"_167":168,"_169":170,"_61":171},{"_54":55,"_60":159,"_56":160,"_58":161,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_60":154,"_56":155,"_68":156},"originalImage","创作者原图",[157],{"_56":155,"_26":158},"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/danymaniglie-cmyk/3d-sakura-crossing/main/docs/anteprima.gif","mediaReviewed","截图来源核查","2026-10-20","image","Creator-published gameplay animation from the repository README.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/sakura-crossing-qwen.webp","Sakura Crossing gameplay in a cel-shaded Japanese neighbourhood at dusk.","https://github.com/danymaniglie-cmyk/3d-sakura-crossing","width",1280,"height",720,"Creator-published screenshot","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型",[176],"Claude Code","相关资源",[180],"resourceIds",{"_56":102,"_26":103},"创作者开发记录",[184],"evidence",{"_56":185,"_26":186,"_187":188},"查看 Qwen 与作者的开发分工","https://github.com/danymaniglie-cmyk/3d-sakura-crossing#credits","note","README explicitly distinguishes locally generated Qwen code from human review, debugging, and extensions. The creator’s linked Reddit build account identifies Claude Code CLI as the harness, not the Claude model.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[193],{"_56":194,"_26":166,"_187":195},"查看完整探索游戏项目","GPL-3.0 source with complete index.html, vendored Three.js, procedural textures, and implementation notes. Run python3 -m http.server 5191 and open localhost:5191/index.html; file:// loading is unsupported. The original author has ended active development. The creator describes an exploration prototype, not a finished campaign; no complete win/loss loop is claimed.","获取方式","playable","试玩与运行",[200],{"_56":201,"_26":202,"_187":203},"Explore Sakura Crossing","https://danymaniglie-cmyk.github.io/3d-sakura-crossing/","Exploration prototype. WASD walks, Shift runs, mouse drag looks, E talks, F enters/exits the car, and Space/C swims up/down. Touch controls included; mobile performance remains limited.","游戏平台","浏览器","指南形式","build log","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[211],{"_56":212,"_26":213,"_187":-7},"阅读渲染与实现指南","https://github.com/danymaniglie-cmyk/3d-sakura-crossing/blob/main/CARTOON.md","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[218,219,220,221],"Explore the browser world on foot, then try the car, river, and moving bridge.","Read the credits and the author’s account of using a local Qwen model through Claude Code CLI.","Inspect CARTOON.md and the complete index.html plus vendored Three.js dependency.","Serve a local copy over HTTP, change one interaction, and verify movement and collisions.","AI 工作流与开发背景","仓库说明代码由本地运行的 Qwen 3.8 27B 生成，再由人手工审查、调试与扩展。作者的开发帖子进一步说明使用 Claude Code CLI 作为执行工具，底层模型为 Qwen。","aiUse","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","引擎","Three.js · JavaScript","ai-assisted",[218,219,220,221],{"_56":241,"_26":213,"_18":242},{"_56":201,"_26":202,"_18":197,"_187":203},{"_56":238,"_26":166,"_239":240,"_187":195},{"_56":237,"_26":186,"_187":188},[124],"Read the Qwen and human contribution credit","Open the complete exploration project","scope","complete-project","Read the rendering and implementation recipe","build-log",{"_244":245},"documents",{"_65":246,"_36":247},[249,253,254,255,252,256,257,258,259,260,261,262,263,264,265,266,267,268,269,270,271,272,273,274,275,276,277,278,279,280,281,282,283,284,285,286,287,251,288,250,289,290,291,292,293,294,295,296,297,298,299,300,301,302,303,304,305,306],[248,249,250,251,252],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-re